  "content": {
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "about",
        "slug": "about",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "I make portraits of people being themselves.",
          "eyebrow": "About",
          "intro": "KELLEN is a small portrait studio. One photographer, one north-facing window and a lot of unhurried conversation.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k1",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "I came to portraits from documentary work, where the best picture is almost never the one you planned. A portrait session should feel closer to a long talk than a photo shoot. We start with tea, we sit for a while, and the camera comes out when you stop noticing it.",
                  "_key": "k1s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k2",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "I work mostly with natural light, a few plain backdrops and as little direction as I can get away with. You will get a handful of images that are properly composed, because they matter, and a larger group that are simply honest.",
                  "_key": "k2s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k3",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "How a session goes",
                  "_key": "k3s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k4",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Before we meet, we talk by email or phone about what the pictures are for and how you would like to feel in them. On the day there is no script. I ask questions, you answer or you do not, and we find the frames as we go.",
                  "_key": "k4s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k5",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "A full online gallery follows within two weeks. You choose your favourites, I retouch them by hand and send the final files with a print licence for personal use.",
                  "_key": "k5s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k6",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Who I photograph",
                  "_key": "k6s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k7",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Writers, makers, musicians, founders, families, couples and people who simply never have a picture they like. If you are nervous in front of a camera, you are in good company; most of my sitters are.",
                  "_key": "k7s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "terms-and-delivery",
        "slug": "terms-and-delivery",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Terms and delivery",
          "eyebrow": "Good to know",
          "intro": "A few things that help every session run smoothly.",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k8",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Booking",
                  "_key": "k8s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k9",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "A booking request is not a confirmed session. I reply by email, agree the session and date with you, and confirm with a short written agreement and a deposit.",
                  "_key": "k9s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k10",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Delivery",
                  "_key": "k10s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k11",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Your private online gallery arrives within two weeks of the session. Retouched finals follow within one week of your choosing.",
                  "_key": "k11s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k12",
              "style": "h2",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Cancellations",
                  "_key": "k12s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k13",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "You can move a session once without charge with 48 hours notice. Deposits are held for six months if the weather or a sitter's health gets in the way.",
                  "_key": "k13s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
    "work": [
      {
        "id": "window-light",
        "slug": "window-light",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Window Light",
          "category": "Natural light",
          "year_label": "Autumn 2026",
          "summary": "Quiet portraits made beside a single north-facing window, one afternoon at a time.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 10,
          "photo": "/images/woman-window.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/woman-window.webp",
              "caption": "Noor, mid-afternoon, with the sun just reaching the wall."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/hand-detail.webp",
              "caption": "A hand, a ring and a long pause."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/redhead-bw.webp",
              "caption": "Imogen, an hour in, in black and white."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/woman-bw.webp",
              "caption": "Noor again, an hour later, in black and white."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/redhead.webp",
              "caption": "Imogen, with the window behind her left shoulder."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/grey-hair.webp",
              "caption": "Teodor, who sat very still for nearly ten minutes."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k14",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Window Light began with a rented room and a single north-facing window. I asked each sitter to choose a spot where they felt comfortable, then waited for the light to do the rest.",
                  "_key": "k14s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k15",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Every portrait here was made in under an hour. Most of the time was spent talking.",
                  "_key": "k15s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "quiet-faces",
        "slug": "quiet-faces",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Quiet Faces",
          "category": "Studio",
          "year_label": "Summer 2026",
          "summary": "Black-and-white studio portraits with a plain backdrop and nowhere to hide.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 20,
          "photo": "/images/man-bw.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/man-bw.webp",
              "caption": "Jonah, laughing at something said off camera."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/redhead-bw.webp",
              "caption": "Imogen, stripped back to tone and texture."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/woman-bw.webp",
              "caption": "Noor, leaning in."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/grey-hair.webp",
              "caption": "Teodor, in soft side light."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/hand-detail.webp",
              "caption": "Detail from the first sitting."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k16",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Quiet Faces is a studio series made on a plain backdrop with soft side light. Without colour or setting, there is only the person in front of the lens.",
                  "_key": "k16s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k17",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Each sitter was given the same instruction: do whatever you would do if I were not here.",
                  "_key": "k17s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "kept-in-colour",
        "slug": "kept-in-colour",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Kept in Colour",
          "category": "On location",
          "year_label": "Spring 2026",
          "summary": "Warm, close portraits made at kitchen tables, studios and front doors across the city.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 30,
          "photo": "/images/redhead.webp",
          "gallery": [
            {
              "photo": "/images/redhead.webp",
              "caption": "Imogen, in her own kitchen."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/woman-window.webp",
              "caption": "Noor, at home."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/grey-hair.webp",
              "caption": "Teodor, by his front door."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/hand-detail.webp",
              "caption": "A hand that has been busy all day."
            },
            {
              "photo": "/images/woman-bw.webp",
              "caption": "Noor, a little later, in black and white."
            }
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k18",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Kept in Colour takes the session to the sitter: their own kitchens, workshops and hallways. Familiar rooms make for easier faces.",
                  "_key": "k18s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k19",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Wherever possible, I use only the light that is already there.",
                  "_key": "k19s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "the-long-way-round",
        "slug": "the-long-way-round",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "The Long Way Round",
          "category": "On location",
          "year_label": "Winter 2025",
