            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "black-and-white-is-not-a-filter",
        "slug": "black-and-white-is-not-a-filter",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Black and white is not a filter",
          "date_label": "14 August 2026",
          "excerpt": "Choosing monochrome before the shutter, not after.",
          "featured": true,
          "position": 3,
          "photo": "/images/man-bw.webp",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k26",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "When I plan a portrait in black and white, I light it differently, pose it differently and talk to the sitter differently. The decision happens before the picture exists.",
                  "_key": "k26s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k27",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "A colour image turned grey is rarely a good black-and-white image. Tone, texture and shape do the work that colour usually does.",
                  "_key": "k27s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "what-to-wear-and-what-to-forget",
        "slug": "what-to-wear-and-what-to-forget",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "What to wear, and what to forget",
          "date_label": "30 July 2026",
          "excerpt": "A short, honest guide to getting dressed for your portrait session.",
          "featured": false,
          "position": 4,
          "photo": "/images/redhead.webp",
          "content": [
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k28",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Wear what you would wear on a good day. Plain, comfortable layers photograph beautifully, and so does the jumper you have owned for ten years.",
                  "_key": "k28s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "block",
              "_key": "k29",
              "style": "normal",
              "children": [
                {
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": "Forget the idea that you need to look like someone else. The best portrait is of you on a day you feel like yourself.",
                  "_key": "k29s"
                }
              ],
              "markDefs": []
            }
          ]
        }
      }
